                      </th>
                      <th className="px-6 py-4 text-sm font-medium text-slate-300">
                        Rubrique
                      </th>
                      <th className="px-6 py-4 text-right text-sm font-medium text-slate-300">
                        Attendu
                      </th>
                      <th className="px-6 py-4 text-right text-sm font-medium text-slate-300">
